The Extravaganza is our biggest day of the year - a whole afternoon of music, food and family fun, and our annual fundraiser for the community [swimming pool we're working to bring back](/facilities/pool).

There's something for everyone on the day:

- **Dog show** - bring your four-legged friend along
- **Football tournaments**
- **Games and stalls**
- **Bouncy castles**
- [**Frazoo**](https://www.frazoo.co.uk) - an exciting and educational animal experience, featuring ​talks&nbsp;and handling sessions with a variety of reptiles and invertebrates
- **Family saunas** with [Somewhere Sauna](https://www.thesomewheresauna.com/dartington) and story telling from [Mica Sinclair](https://www.instagram.com/micasinclair) 12–2pm - all income from ticket sales goes straight to the pool project. [Book now](https://app.acuityscheduling.com/schedule/8e735c9f/?appointmentTypeIds%5B%5D=94966625)
- **Wacky Races** - Fun and games on the Bike track and MUGA. Thanks to [KOM Cycle coaching](https://www.komcoaching.uk).
- **Raffle** - Prize announcements coming soon.
- **Hair colouring**
- **Massage**
- **Cake sale** - [let us know](mailto:extravaganza@meadowbrookdartington.org) if you'd like to donate a cake
- **BBQ**
- **Pizza** from [Pizzalogica](https://pizzalogica.uk)
- **Drinks** from [Things Happen Here](https://thingshappenhere.co.uk)
- **Consultation stall** - come and share your thoughts on the future of Meadowbrook and the pool

This page will grow as the day gets closer — the full timetable will appear here nearer the time. For now, here's how you can be part of it.

## Can you lend a hand?

We rely on volunteers to make the day happen, and we'd love your help. We're looking for people to:

- Help man the stalls
- Run the BBQ
- Help set up in the morning and pack down at the end
- [Deliver leaflets](/deliver-leaflets) to spread the word

Even an hour or two makes a real difference. [Email the team](mailto:extravaganza@meadowbrookdartington.org) and we'll find you a spot.

## Want to run a stall or perform?

If you'd like to host a stall, or be part of the day's line-up, we'd love to hear from you. [Get in touch](mailto:extravaganza@meadowbrookdartington.org) to register your interest before the timetable is set.
